{"step_index":244,"source":"MODEL","type":"PLANNER_RESPONSE","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-11-24T23:37:31Z","thinking":"Initial hypothesis: investigate `render_chapter_3` within the flowchart builder script. Determined that the current chapter layout uses width 20 and height 13. Will now restructure the rendering logic to include mission ranges and branched groups in a new format.\n\n\nRevised rendering logic to accommodate three converging story strands, introducing a new layout with width 22 and height 13. Defined the first column with specific coordinates for initial chapter events and drew arrows from the initial event to a safehouse milestone. Identified three parallel strands emerging from the milestone, each featuring distinct characters and mission titles within Columns 2 and 3.\n\n\nDefined coordinates and elements for the second and third story strands. Strand 2 involves \"Boobie & Dre (Syndicate)\", and Strand 3 involves \"Raul & Randy (Cartel & Cars)\". Each strand includes multiple mission cards, milestones, and arrows to visualize the narrative flow. All three strands converge into a single point.\n\n\n","tool_calls":[{"name":"replace_file_content","args":{"AllowMultiple":false,"Description":"Update Chapter 3 to show 3 parallel strands in build_all_flowcharts.py","EndLine":408,"Instruction":"Restructure render_chapter_3 to clearly depict the 3 parallel alliance strands and their convergence into Mission 61","ReplacementContent":"def render_chapter_3():\n    fig, ax = plt.subplots(figsize=(22, 13), dpi=200)\n    fig.patch.set_facecolor(BG_COLOR)\n    ax.set_facecolor(BG_COLOR)\n    ax.set_xlim(0, 22)\n    ax.set_ylim(0, 13)\n    ax.axis(\"off\")\n    \n    draw_title(\n        ax,\n        \"GRAND THEFT AUTO VI — CHAPTER 3: TITS, ASS, DRUG MONEY\",\n        \"Setting: Vice City Outskirts & Cartel Hubs | Missions 45 - 70 | 3 Parallel Strands -> Sinfrontera Heist\",\n        22,\n        y_top=12.4\n    )\n    \n    w, h = 3.2, 1.05\n    \n    # Column 1: Missions 45 - 50 (Spine)\n    col1 = [\n        (\"45. Welcome to Vice City\", \"Arrival in the Metropolis\", \"\", \"normal\"),\n        (\"46. Dealer's Choice\", \"Underground Casino Meeting\", \"\", \"normal\"),\n        (\"47. Meet the Heders\", \"Local Smuggler Syndicate\", \"\", \"normal\"),\n        (\"48. Dubious Provenance\", \"Handling Hot Merchandise\", \"\", \"normal\"),\n        (\"49. Mami Knows Best\", \"Vice City Cartel Liaison\", \"\", \"normal\"),\n        (\"50. South Leonida Real Estate\", \"Safehouse Unlocked -> 3 Strands Open\", \"Safehouse\", \"milestone\"),\n    ]\n    \n    for r, (t, sub, b, ct) in enumerate(col1):\n        cy = 10.8 - r * 1.5\n        draw_card(ax, 0.6, cy, w, h, t, sub, b, ct)\n        if r < len(col1) - 1:\n            draw_arrow(ax, (0.6 + w/2, cy), (0.6 + w/2, cy - 0.45))\n            \n    # From Mission 50 -> Fan out to 3 Strands\n    m50_pt = (0.6 + w, 10.8 - 5 * 1.5 + h/2)\n    \n    # STRAND 1: TYRONE (Street Muscle)\n    s1_x1, s1_x2 = 4.3, 7.8\n    draw_card(ax, s1_x1, 10.8, w, h, \"51. Tyrone\", \"Street Level Muscle Contract\", \"Strand 1\", \"normal\")\n    draw_card(ax, s1_x2, 10.8, w, h, \"52. Here, Kitty Kitty\", \"Vice Strip Club Contract\", \"Strand 1\", \"normal\")\n    draw_arrow(ax, (s1_x1 + w, 11.32), (s1_x2, 11.32))\n    draw_arrow(ax, m50_pt, (s1_x1, 11.32), color=\"#38bdf8\", rad=-0.25)\n    \n    # STRAND 2: BOOBIE & DRE'QUAN (Syndicate)\n    s2_y = 9.2\n    draw_card(ax, s1_x1, s2_y, w, h, \"54. Top Billing\", \"High-End Nightclub Job\", \"Strand 2\", \"normal\")\n    draw_card(ax, s1_x2, s2_y, w, h, \"55. Boobie Time\", \"Boobie Ike Alliance Formed\", \"Key Contact\", \"milestone\")\n    draw_card(ax, s1_x2, 7.6, w, h, \"56. First Impressions\", \"Syndicate Introductions\", \"Strand 2\", \"normal\")\n    draw_arrow(ax, (s1_x1 + w, s2_y + h/2), (s1_x2, s2_y + h/2))\n    draw_arrow(ax, (s1_x2 + w/2, s2_y), (s1_x2 + w/2, 7.6 + h))\n    draw_arrow(ax, m50_pt, (s1_x1, s2_y + h/2), color=\"#a855f7\", rad=-0.15)\n    \n    # Parallel Routing Badge\n    badge_box = patches.FancyBboxPatch(\n        (s1_x1, 7.5), w, 1.2,\n        boxstyle=\"round,pad=0.03,rounding_size=0.15\",\n        linewidth=1.2, edgecolor=\"#10b981\", facecolor=\"#064e3b\", zorder=2\n    )\n    ax.add_patch(badge_box)\n    ax.text(s1_x1 + w/2, 8.4, \"⚡ 3 PARALLEL STRANDS\", ha=\"center\", va=\"center\", fontsize=8, fontweight=\"bold\", color=\"#34d399\", zorder=3)\n    ax.text(s1_x1 + w/2, 7.85, \"Contacts enter cooldown after missions.\\nSpeedrunners zigzag between strands;\\ncasual play shows all 3 on map.\", ha=\"center\", va=\"center\", fontsize=6.2, color=\"#ecfdf5\", zorder=3)\n    \n    # STRAND 3: RAUL & RANDY (Cartel & Cars)\n    draw_card(ax, s1_x1, 5.9, w, h, \"53. Car Service\", \"Luxury Vehicle Interception\", \"Strand 3\", \"normal\")\n    draw_card(ax, s1_x1, 4.4, w, h, \"57. Caught Slipping\", \"Surviving Competitor Ambush\", \"Strand 3\", \"normal\")\n    draw_card(ax, s1_x1, 2.9, w, h, \"58. Crosstown Traffic\", \"Highway Pursuit & Escape\", \"Strand 3\", \"normal\")\n    draw_card(ax, s1_x1, 1.4, w, h, \"59. Credit Check\", \"Background Probe on Raul\", \"Strand 3\", \"normal\")\n    draw_card(ax, s1_x2, 1.4, w, h, \"60. Steal Zorrusso for Randy\", \"Exotic Supercar Booster\", \"Strand 3\", \"normal\")\n    \n    draw_arrow(ax, m50_pt, (s1_x1, 5.9 + h/2), color=\"#f59e0b\", rad=0.15)\n    draw_arrow(ax, (s1_x1 + w/2, 5.9), (s1_x1 + w/2, 5.45))\n    draw_arrow(ax, (s1_x1 + w/2, 4.4), (s1_x1 + w/2, 3.95))\n    draw_arrow(ax, (s1_x1 + w/2, 2.9), (s1_x1 + w/2, 2.45))\n    draw_arrow(ax, (s1_x1 + w, 1.4 + h/2), (s1_x2, 1.4 + h/2))\n    \n    # HEIST SCOPE OUT CONVERGENCE (Mission 61)\n    heist_scope_y = 4.2\n    draw_card(ax, s1_x2, heist_scope_y, w, 1.35, \"61. Sinfrontera National Bank\", \"HEIST SCOPE OUT & PLANNING BOARD\\nAll 3 Strands Converge Here!\", \"CONVERGENCE\", \"heist\")\n    \n    # Arrows from Strand 1, 2, 3 into Mission 61\n    draw_arrow(ax, (s1_x2 + w/2